[{"id":180136084,"discussion_id":"80b45db9428c832c13af11b98055d8664255f571","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本次 PR 主要针对 `TopkV2` 算子的 Ascend ACLNN 接口实现进行修复，涉及文件 `index/gather_elements/op_api/aclnn_topk.cpp`，代码变更量较大（+477/-414 行），属于对 `aclnn_topk` 接口实现的重构级修复，旨在解决商业分支中 `TopkV2` 在 ACLNN 后端上的接口兼容性问题。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`aclnn_topk.cpp` 整体重构**：对 `TopkV2` 的 ACLNN 接口实现进行了大范围重写，新增 477 行、删除 414 行，调整了算子调用逻辑和参数处理流程。\n- **ACLNN 接口适配修复**：修复了 `TopkV2` 在商业分支中调用 ACLNN 原生接口时的兼容性问题，确保算子在不同 Ascend 固件版本下正确执行。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-15T14:46:18+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T15:03:11+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180136086,"discussion_id":"554be0b1ea8b4c0637338e89e861c308f83c4387","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n**注意**：本次审查中，审查工具提供的 diff 内容显示为空（\"The file is empty\"），与 PR 统计信息（+477/-414 行变更）不符。以下发现基于当前工作区代码状态（假定为合入后代码）进行分析，置信度相应降低。\n\n### 审查的文件\n\n- **`index/gather_elements/op_api/aclnn_topk.cpp`**：发现 3 个问题\n\n### 按优先级汇总\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| P1 | 1 | `SortAndTopK` 空指针检查后缺少 return，崩溃风险 |\n| P2 | 1 | `TopKCopy` 返回值被丢弃，失败被报告为成功 |\n| P3 | 1 | `sortDimValue` 来源与 `positiveDim` 不一致（轻微建议） |\n\n### 整体风险评估\n\n**中等风险**。P1 问题在 Sort 返回空指针的异常路径下可能导致崩溃；P2 问题在 TopKCopy 内部失败时会掩盖错误，使调用方在数据未正确初始化的情况下继续执行。建议优先修复 P1（添加 `return`）和 P2（添加 `CHECK_RET`），这两个修复简洁且明确。P3 为防御性改进，可按需处理。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 1 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 1 |\n\n⛔ 需要修改\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-15T14:46:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T15:12:13+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180136122,"discussion_id":"fdea216bcb24fd964fb0c4a6467e2912fbbe4695","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n caoyan_huawei, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-15T14:46:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T14:46:26+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180136124,"discussion_id":"d510443fa8e9dc607e7aaa7ad11e26ebde156964","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| \\*\\* | ✅ [*gcw_kUomxQ2l*](https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l), [*唐玮玮*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2) (2/2) | ✅ [*gcw_kUomxQ2l*](https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)","created_at":"2026-07-15T14:46:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T17:33:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"c