son/bab33b0f-3b44-4003-b2de-85d8b3f1370a?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table>","created_at":"2026-07-15T14:52:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T14:52:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180143770,"discussion_id":"7417f92ded7822732ee763f729f3b9b9cc1babb2","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n在 `SortAndTopK` 函数（第438-440行）中，检测到 `l0op::Sort` 返回的 values 或 indices 为 nullptr 后，仅通过 `OP_LOGE` 记录了错误日志，但未执行 `return` 提前退出。随后第442-443行继续将空指针传递给 `TopKSplit`，该函数内部调用 `l0op::SplitV(x, ...)`，当 `x` 为 nullptr 时极可能导致段错误崩溃。虽然外层调用方（第762行、第815行）会对 `topkOut` 做空指针检查，但崩溃发生在 `SortAndTopK` 内部，外层检查无法拦截。应在空指针检查后返回 `{nullptr, nullptr}`。\n\n```suggestion\n    if (std::get<0>(sortOut) == nullptr || std::get<1>(sortOut) == nullptr) {\n        OP_LOGE(ACLNN_ERR_INNER_NULLPTR, \"Sort result is null, Please check Sort\");\n        return std::tie(nullptr, nullptr);\n    }\n```\n","created_at":"2026-07-15T15:12:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T16:35:02+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"6721d7324692e91fb729c5b3","login":"caoyan_huawei","object_id":"6721d7324692e91fb729c5b3","name":"cy_hw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ec/ba/8e58cba8a3a64e5d83547d79686c0ce87c0c4fa28c1376d38ea2a6d164e66a57.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/caoyan_huawei"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":437,"end_new_line":437,"start_old_line":391,"end_old_line":391,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":180143771,"discussion_id":"24836890152f4572529ec1697e0217888058bc10","body":"\uD83D\uDFE1 **Medium Priority**\n\n在 `aclnnTopkGetWorkspaceSize` 函数（第709行）中，`TopKCopy()` 的返回值（`aclnnStatus`）被直接丢弃，未进行任何检查。该函数内部可能因 `CopyContiguousOrView` 失败（返回 `ACLNN_ERR_INNER_NULLPTR`）或 `GenIndicesNonLastDim`/`GenIndicesLastDim` 返回 nullptr（触发 `CHECK_RET` 返回错误码）而失败。由于返回值被忽略，代码在第711-713行无条件设置 `workspaceSize` 并返回 `ACLNN_SUCCESS`，导致调用方误认为操作成功，但实际 values/indices 输出可能处于未初始化或部分写入状态。同一函数中所有其他类似调用（如 `Contiguous`、`Transpose` 等）均使用 `CHECK_RET` 宏检查返回值，此处明显遗漏。\n\n**建议**：使用 CHECK_RET 宏检查 TopKCopy 的返回值，与其他调用保持一致。\n\n```suggestion\n        CHECK_RET(TopKCopy(selfCast, k, positiveDim, lastDim, valuesOut, indicesOut, uniqueExecutor.get()) == ACLNN_SUCCESS, ACLNN_ERR_INNER_NULLPTR);\n```\n","created_at":"2026-07-15T15:12:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T16:35:00+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"6721d7324692e91fb729c5b3","login":"caoyan_huawei","object_id":"6721d7324692e91fb729c5b3","name":"cy_hw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ec/ba/8e58cba8a3a64e5d83547d79686c0ce87c0c4fa28c1376d38ea2a6d164e66a57.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/caoyan_huawei"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":706,"end_new_line":706,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":180170045,"discussion_id":"8de1b5a4c847e011f3fddb2e3fb67f7214738e9b","body":"compile\n","created_at":"2026-07-15T16:37:01+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T16:37:01+08:00","user":{"id":"6721d7324692e91fb729c5b3","login":"caoyan_huawei","object_id":"6721d7324692e91fb729c5b3","name":"cy_hw","avat